St Bede C of EPrimary School
Welcome to St Bede C of E Primary School
We strive to provide an excellent education for all our pupils within a caring, inclusive, stimulating and motivating learning environment. To help us achieve this aim, staff, governors and parents work in close partnership together with added support from the Diocese of Winchester and the local parish churches of St. Bartholomew’s and Holy Trinity. Being a Church of England school, our ethos is embedded in our Christian values which underpin all areas of school life.
